[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0010","text":"喂，制片人\n这个我看了哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0020","text":"嗯，是新服装的设计图"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0030","text":"嗯～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0040","text":"超可爱的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0050","text":"哈哈，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0060","text":"诶，什么时候穿～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0070","text":"不用急，下次的活动上\n会穿很多次的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0080","text":"啊哈～\n这样啊～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0090","text":"那，好期待呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300200_02_0100","text":"哈哈，是啊"}]
